  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 31.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif he ongean geonbyrde oððe æhlip gewirce, ⁊ hine man þonne þurh þæt afille, licge ægilde eallum his freondum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he offers resistance to the course of justice or commits a breach of the law, and through that brings about his own death, no compensation shall be paid for him to any of his friends.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf he ongean riht þurh æhlyp geonbyrde ⁊ swa gewyrce, þæt hine man afylle, licge ægylde eallan his freondan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
